   "date": "2017-01-17T17:42:39Z",
   "subject": "How does the 'appFiles' argument work in deployApp()?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I assumed that I could just pass a vector of file paths, but when I do that I get an error.<div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> files<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./YCC-Baseline-Conditions.Rproj&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                      <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./style.css&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                                          <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./app.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                                              <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./1-data/5-tidy/comb-long-sf.rds&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                     <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./global.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> deployApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">appFiles </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> files</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Preparing</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> to deploy application</span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DONE<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Uploading</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bundle </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">138560.</span><span style=\"color:#660\">..</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> createAppManifest</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bundleDir</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> appMode</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> contentCategory</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hasParameters</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Application</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mode </span><span style=\"color:#008\">static</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> requires at least one document</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>What am I missing here?</div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "yXgHdtpvGAAJ",
   "from": "Joshua Spiewak",
   "author": "299a5089d6c6c523",
