   "subject": "Re: [shinyapps-users] How does the 'appFiles' argument work in deployApp()?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Try removing the leading &quot;./&quot; from the file names.<div>My reading of the <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/rsconnect/blob/master/R/bundle.R#L262\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/rsconnect/blob/master/R/bundle.R%23L262&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361327856000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1KB-oZitBwfO6ZVNJ16sE1\">rsconnect code</a> says that it is attempting a full string match on app.R.</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Tue, Jan 17, 2017 at 12:42 PM Tiernan Martin &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tierna...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I assumed that I could just pass a vector of file paths, but when I do that I get an error.<div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> files<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./YCC-Baseline-Conditions.Rproj&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                      <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./style.css&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                                          <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./app.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                                              <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./1-data/5-tidy/comb-long-sf.rds&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                     <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./global.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> deployApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">appFiles </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> files</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Preparing</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> to deploy application</span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DONE<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Uploading</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bundle </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">138560.</span><span style=\"color:#660\">..</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> createAppManifest</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bundleDir</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> appMode</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> contentCategory</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hasParameters</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Application</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mode </span><span style=\"color:#008\">static</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> requires at least one document</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>What am I missing here?</div></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
    ],
